derick and kit  but managed to swipe some poker chips  and coins as souvenirs  this is all right isn't it but the  damage was done  i've just got all the guns the most  challenging part of creating the entire  series was left up to author  leigh bardugo and co-creator eric  heisserer  we all know the story of elena starkov  on her quest to learn magic and save her  country but lee has another series  called six of crows  that had to be worked into the show as  well lee and eric had to rewrite entire  character prequels just to make it work  and rework the timeline  in a way that made sense so if you had  read the books and were a little  confused as to how the two series were  meshed together  here's your answer look gracious women's  scamming  okay what would an epic series be  without an  even more epic theme song and soundtrack  it was composed by joseph trapenezi  who has already created epic music for  projects like divergent  the greatest showman and tron for the  theme song they stuck with the slavic  theme  in order for it to fit perfectly with  the series russian-inspired roots  author lee even gave it her stamp of  approval the first time she heard it  after spending months in budapest  together it's no surprise that the cast  became the best of friends  just one look at their instagram  accounts and you get a sneak peek  at how much of a family they became both  on and off set  amita said that the connection she had  to everyone is what made the experience  amazing for her she was convinced she  had met kit  before the chemistry read because of  their strong connection  for some reason i was just like mate  have we met before  i said their love for one another  translated into love for their  characters  the series became so important to them  that inej kaz's  and jasper's weapons were all presented  in a ceremony  because of how iconic they were even  shadow and bone author lee became part  of their family  just take a look at how emotional they  were th